    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a subject I both love and struggle with. As someone pursuing a bachelor's degree, I find its logical structure fascinating, especially in fields like biology where it helps me analyze data. However, the abstract nature of certain concepts can be overwhelming at times. My relationship with math is one of deep curiosity mixed with occasional frustration, but I keep pushing through because I see its value.",
