    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I did experiment with AI tools like Khan Academy’s practice modules and online solvers for specific problems. The experience was mixed—some explanations were clear and helpful, but others felt too abstract or lacked depth. I prefer a balance between AI guidance and human-led teaching, especially when dealing with advanced topics.",
